<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30117" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκάρδι-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in the heart</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκάρδιόν ἐστί</span> (or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γίγνεταί</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> τί
				τινι</span> it goes <i>to</i> his <i>heart</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Democr.
				262
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.45
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τἀγκ. τις ἐρεῖ</span>
			<i>what is in</i> his <i>heart</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Lib.</u>
				p.14
			</span></i> O. Adv., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν γεννηθῇς ἐγκαρδίως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMag.Par.</u>
					1.1785
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>in close proximity</i>, of planets, Antioch.Astr.in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				8(3).105
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκάρδιον, τό </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκάρδιος, ὁ</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				9.119
			</span></i>), <i>heart-wood, core</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.8.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.3.2
			</span></i>; <i>pith</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.109.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				12.25.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>core</i>, Roussel <i>Cultes Égyptiens</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				236
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>).</div>
